    Local: <a href="tel:+16088318445">(608) 831-8445</a>
  </p>
  <h3>Email</h3>
  <p>
    <a href="mailto:compliance@ebcflex.com">compliance@ebcflex.com</a>
  </p>

  <h2>Effective Date</h2>
  <p>This Privacy Statement was last updated November 2025.</p>
</EbcMarketingLegal>
